<div class="card p-4 shadow-sm mb-5">
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2">Why Native?</h2>
    <p class="text-muted mb-4">
        Most cross-platform tools ship a browser inside your app. We don't.
    </p>

    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="p-3 border rounded h-100">
                <h6 class="text-uppercase text-muted small mb-3">Idle RAM Usage</h6>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-baseline gap-2 mb-1">
                    <span class="fw-bold">Electron app</span>
                    <span class="text-danger ms-auto">~400 MB to 800 MB</span>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-baseline gap-2">
                    <span class="fw-bold">WinUI 3 / MAUI</span>
                    <span class="text-primary ms-auto">~50 MB to 150 MB</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="p-3 border rounded h-100">
                <h6 class="text-uppercase text-muted small mb-3">Cold Start Time</h6>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-baseline gap-2 mb-1">
                    <span class="fw-bold">Electron app</span>
                    <span class="text-danger ms-auto">3.0 to 5.0+ seconds</span>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-baseline gap-2">
                    <span class="fw-bold">WinUI 3 / MAUI</span>
                    <span class="text-primary ms-auto">&lt;1.5 seconds</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="p-3 border rounded h-100">
                <h6 class="text-uppercase text-muted small mb-3">Install Size</h6>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-baseline gap-2 mb-1">
                    <span class="fw-bold">Electron app</span>
                    <span class="text-danger ms-auto">~120 MB to 250 MB</span>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-baseline gap-2">
                    <span class="fw-bold">WinUI 3 / MAUI</span>
                    <span class="text-primary ms-auto">~30 MB to 60 MB</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="small text-muted mt-4 mb-0">
        Figures are typical ranges based on common Electron vs. native Windows app benchmarks — actual results vary by app complexity.
    </p>
</div>